%% Lifecycle of an external module provider connecting over the module-provider protocol.
%% Render with: ./render-diagrams.sh  (mmdc + mermaid-config.json + --pdfFit, keeps text legible at \linewidth)
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant P as External provider<br/>(e.g. AI service)
    participant G as Module-provider gateway
    participant M as ExperimentSessionManager
    participant L as Session log

    P->>G: Hello (providerId, modules, capabilities)
    alt protocol and modules accepted
        G-->>P: Welcome (acceptedModules, heartbeatTimeout)
    else mismatch or already claimed
        G-->>P: Error (code)
    end

    loop while active
        P-->>G: Heartbeat
        M->>G: per-module context
        G-->>P: Inbound (moduleId, context)
        P-->>G: Outbound (moduleId, command)
        G->>M: apply via standard validation + logging
        M->>L: record intervention (source = external provider)
    end

    Note over P,M: missed heartbeat or disconnect
    G->>M: degrade strategy to built-in fallback
    M->>L: record provider disconnect (FR19.3)
